<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		Roo's Minotaur hands its oversized-weapon handling to Big and Small rather than running a parallel system.
		  - The minotaur xenotype swaps the Herculean gene for B&amp;S's giant weapon wielder and large frame, and the
		    retired gene goes on this mod's Cherry Picker list.
		  - The eight minotaur weapons move from Roo's own RBM_HerculeanClass to B&amp;S's BS_GiantWeapon class, so one
		    weapon-class system governs who can lift them.
		  - The Harrier pawn kind's weapon tags are rewritten around B&amp;S's RangedHeavyGiant tag.
		This folder only loads when Roo's Minotaur Xenotype is active (see loadFolders.xml); the Big and Small modules
		are gated by subfolder.
		Operations that also need another mod sit in a subfolder gated on it in loadFolders.xml.

		Verified against the current 1.6 releases: the xenotype does carry RBM_Herculean and neither B&amp;S gene, all
		eight weapons list RBM_HerculeanClass, and BS_GiantWeapon is a real WeaponClassDef, defined in Big and Small -
		Framework rather than Genes &amp; More, which is what that operation's gate checks for.

		One judgement call: the descriptionHyperlinks removal sits here rather than with the description rewrites in the
		Integrations mod. It strips the weapons' info-card link to the Herculean gene, which only makes sense once that
		gene has been retired by the operations above. Move it across if you would rather keep all the description work
		together.
		Split by category into the MMMM Convergence sub-mods: this copy holds only the Genetics ops (genes and xenotypes).
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationReplace">
		<xpath>Defs/XenotypeDef[defName="RBM_Minotaur"]/genes/li[text()="RBM_Herculean"]</xpath>
		<value>
			<li>BS_GiantWeaponWielder</li>
			<li>BS_LargeFrame</li>
		</value>
	</Operation>
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
		<xpath>Defs/CherryPicker.DefList[defName="MMMM_ConvergenceGenetics_CherryPicker_Basics"]/defs</xpath>
		<value>
			<li>GeneDef/RBM_Herculean</li>
			<li>GeneDef/RBM_Herculean_Astrogene</li>
		</value>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
